# Claude Code worktrees (Workflow tool isolation:'worktree') — ephemeral,
# never meant to be tracked; un-ignored accumulation committed 73 orphaned
# gitlinks to main over 2026-07-10..08-16, breaking checkout's post-job
# `git submodule foreach` (no .gitmodules entry -> exit 128 warning every run)
.claude/worktrees/
